.md
Here is is rather easy. We accept association generated by `analyzeImage`, take initial 4 corners and make them draggable. On drag `handle` is called with updated coordinates, which updates line segments as well as stored association. We avoid here `Module` to prevent symbols from garbage collecting. Try try it out on `img` run

